==========================================================================
PROJETO PRATICO 8 - REDE CORPORATIVA OMNITECH SOLUCOES
Blocos de configuracao IOS CLI usados na topologia - registro para auditoria
Baseado no arquivo "Trabalho Oficial.pkt" (2 Multilayer Switch 3650-24PS,
3 Switch 2960-24TT, 2 Server-PT, ~30 PC-PT) + ajuste de STP recomendado
(spanning-tree mode pvst -> rapid-pvst em Switch0, Switch1, MLS0, MLS1)
==========================================================================


--------------------------------------------------------------------------
DEVICE: Switch0  (2960-24TT, L2, VLAN de acesso 83 - Suporte)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
!
hostname Switch0
!
ip arp inspection vlan 81-83
!
ip dhcp snooping vlan 80-83
no ip dhcp snooping information option
ip dhcp snooping
!
spanning-tree mode rapid-pvst
spanning-tree extend system-id
!
! Portas de acesso Fa0/1 a Fa0/10 - uma estacao de trabalho por porta,
! VLAN 83, Port Security com limite de 1 MAC e bloqueio automatico,
! PortFast + BPDU Guard para convergencia imediata sem gerar BPDU
!
interface FastEthernet0/1
 switchport access vlan 83
 switchport mode access
 switchport port-security
 switchport port-security maximum 1
 switchport port-security violation shutdown
 spanning-tree portfast
 spanning-tree bpduguard enable
!
! (repetir o mesmo bloco para FastEthernet0/2 ate FastEthernet0/10)
!
interface GigabitEthernet0/1
 ip arp inspection trust
 ip dhcp snooping trust
 switchport mode trunk
!
interface GigabitEthernet0/2
 ip arp inspection trust
 ip dhcp snooping trust
 switchport mode trunk
!
interface Vlan1
 no ip address
 shutdown
!
line con 0
line vty 0 4
 login
line vty 5 15
 login
!
end


